# TF2's Flame Thrower at a wall and in open air, first and third person
# (specs/tf2/flames.md: the stream's sprites ride the flame points, slide
# up a wall, reach about 340 units). On de_dust2's T side, standing.
#   cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1280x720 +volume 0 +sandbox cs_source:de_dust2 \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/tf2_flames.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 1500
god
sandbox ammo on
rung tf2:tf_weapon_flamethrower
wait 2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 120
setpos 240 -547 12
setang 2 4
wait 90
shot_after shot 25 wall_fp
+attack
wait 40
-attack
wait 60
setpos 240 -547 12
setang 0 184
wait 90
shot_after shot 25 air_fp
+attack
wait 40
-attack
wait 60
sandbox thirdperson on
cam_idealdist 200
cam_idealyaw 70
setpos 240 -547 12
setang 2 4
wait 90
shot_after shot 25 wall_tp
+attack
wait 40
-attack
wait 60
setpos 240 -547 12
setang 0 184
wait 90
shot_after shot 25 air_tp
+attack
wait 40
-attack
wait 60
